lsl-definitions installs data files, not a library.

    find_package(unofficial-lsl-definitions CONFIG REQUIRED)

sets LSL_DEFINITIONS_DIR to the directory holding lsl_keywords.xml,
lua_keywords.xml, the .yaml definitions and the Luau type stubs.

It also sets LSL_DEFINITIONS_GENERATOR to LL's gen_definitions.py, which
writes C++ from the definitions (it needs Python 3 with PyYAML and llsd).
